  "behavior_notes": [
    "Existing firing, aiming, service and deployment logic retained. Fixed turret head pivots aligned to authoritative eyes; remote turret barrels at the existing 1.2 metre firing axis.",
    "Packed body/head offset is shared; nested placement-preview meshes receive the ghost material.",
    "Raindance generator frame excludes distant vehicle stations; damage surface now aligns to BSP housing.",
    "Raindance fixed sensors gain compact native solid/damage fixtures at 60% of Stonehenge size. All 32 original spawn capsules and station approach points tested clear.",
    "Old compatibility fixtures now omit the later vehicles field when constructing historical recordings. No production protocol changes."
  ],
